# Semgrep paths to ignore (gitignore-style).
# See: https://semgrep.dev/docs/ignoring-files-folders-code/

# ── Documentation and design mockups ────────────────────────────────────
# docs/design/design_handoff_yancotv/ contains React mockups (.jsx)
# delivered by the design team. They are not part of the shipping bundle
# (no Vite glob references them; verified 2026-05-14). Semgrep was
# flagging dangerouslySetInnerHTML and wildcard postMessage in these
# mockups — neither reaches production.
docs/

# ── Build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
dist-electron/
dist-apk/
build/
out/

# ── Frozen workspace ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# packages/mobile/ is the abandoned RN port (frozen 2026-04-20). Excluded
# from the pnpm workspace as of 2026-05-14 and not part of any active
# build target. Kept on disk as a historical reference only.
packages/mobile/

# ── Standard noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.gradle/
.idea/
.vscode/
**/.next/
**/coverage/

# ── Per-machine config (gitignored) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Defence in depth: local.properties is gitignored, but secret-scanners
# walk the filesystem. Repeating the exclusion here avoids re-flagging
# every audit run.
**/local.properties
